cbp.dll is distributed under the GNU GPL version 3, with an additional permission to link with F4SE. It is a fork of OpenCBP_FO4 / OCBPC, whose code it carries under the MIT licence. Both texts are in F4SE\Plugins\Anatomy. Source: [url=https://github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-ocbpc]github.com/ReidenXerx/fo4-ocbpc[/url]. The builder runs on Python and Pillow, whose licences are in Tools\AnatomyBuilder\licences.
